WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,070
Hello, I’m here to apply

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,240
Sorry you are not suitable

3
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:09,450
Boss, you can’t just look at appearance for your ability.

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:11,330
I don’t have high salary requirements

5
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,290
Three thousand or two thousand is fine too

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,420
I don’t want you because of your hair

7
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,620
You shouldn't be in school at your age

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,630
I'm out of school

9
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:23,730
i can support myself

10
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:26,110
And I’ve worked in many milk tea shops

11
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,150
Is there a place where you are good at making juice?

12
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:37,250
Yes, I will definitely not be late after riding my bike for half an hour. I will give you a chance. There is a step-by-step material package on the refrigerator. I can also make a cup of it. Let me take a look.
